  <!-- ── Definition body ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <body>
    Serialization is neither pure compute nor network—it's the translator between them. It is the process of converting live, in-memory objects from your application into a standardized text format (like XML or JSON) so they can be safely transmitted across the network and understood by a completely different machine on the other side.
  </body>
